-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-current-base.md`\n\n- Byte count: `2815`\n- Content digest: `sha256:70f5f797cfdf81e5a2b274846e317223c2cbbbdf1c4b41b59fe46d09dc70acd8`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260909-2ez769_rework-rev3.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260909-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_rework-rev3.md`\n\n- Byte count: `3001`\n- Content digest: `sha256:553782db41a386bdf1c444d40fbca3ff396aa0a0913e59e6ea0d46d7f7bc7ada`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-after-rev3.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260909-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-after-rev3.md`\n\n- Byte count: `2426`\n- Content digest: `sha256:bd0585b3521067e2cbe22909ee6deb2ae86e7b8ff727b0be583fce953f896a6b`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-after-rev3-current.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260909-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-after-rev3-current.md`\n\n- Byte count: `3388`\n- Content digest: `sha256:bac7ff39d3935a3998425dd06b28bf6c765aae293118d2e00e36da053a9e7765`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260909-2ez769_rework-rev4.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260909-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_rework-rev4.md`\n\n- Byte count: `5824`\n- Content digest: `sha256:53167f936d6b2ed658b2802cd25dd132247b26e9bb7db9e6b9d567d7cb0710ff`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n\n\n## Evidence and Safety\n\n- Add/update a task-scoped outcome named `TASK-260909-2ez769_*` before handoff:\n  `task-board m 'add_resource(TASK-260909-2ez769, name=TASK-260909-2ez769_results.md, content=\"...\", type=outcome, description=\"Handoff evidence\")'`\n- Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior ships with negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject; prove the bound by narrowing it, not only by deleting it, and name the production call site. Shapes and incidents: `references/negative-evidence.md`.\n- An absence and a failure to read are different facts; report unknown instead of inferring a property from a proxy signal.\n- Stop-The-Line only for an evidence-backed external blocker or unresolved human-only product/platform/architecture/approval decision. Persist evidence, failed attempts, options/tradeoffs, recommendation, and exact input needed; otherwise rework autonomously.\n- `to-review` is a role handoff, not accepted completion. Report **ready for review** or **handed off to review**.\n\n## LAST — Run For Role Handoff\n\nAfter AC, checklist, validation, and outcome evidence:\n\n```bash\ntask-board handoff TASK-260909-2ez769 --role developer\n```\n\n## Working Directory\nBoard directory: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board`\n\nWork in the project root. Never edit board files directly.\n\n## Story Workspace\n\nYou are running in an isolated Git worktree for STORY-260830-1kiyj6.\n\n- Workspace path: `.temp/STORY-260830-1kiyj6/worktree` (this is your working directory)\n- Branch: `task-board/story/STORY-260830-1kiyj6`, forked from `main`\n- Authoritative board: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board` (already exported as `TASK_BOARD_DIR`)\n\nMake every repository change here. Do not commit, switch, rebase, merge, or delete this branch, and do not run `task-board` against the `.task-board` copy inside this worktree — it is a checkout artifact, not the board. Integration into trunk is the orchestrator's step, not yours.\n\nLeave your work UNCOMMITTED in the worktree — the handoff snapshots the working tree against the recorded checkpoint. A commit of your own on this branch is refused at handoff with `change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint`, and the repair is `git reset --soft <checkpoint_oid>` before completing again.\n"}}
