calls and named tests and precise bounds. Full configured local validation before the normal producer handoff; no hosted CI. Read the Curator-managed go-testing-tools skill first. Leave the candidate UNCOMMITTED in the managed Story worktree (.temp/STORY-260830-1kiyj6/worktree) for the handoff snapshot; no manual commits, no direct .task-board edits, no self-acceptance. Attach outcome, RED reproductions and final evidence through task-board with task-scoped names (TASK-260909-2ez769_results-rev5.md, TASK-260909-2ez769_producer-evidence-rev5.tar.gz). Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Model: muse muse-spark max. The independent reviewer will be codex gpt-6-astra low.","final_result":true}}}
