{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e3c9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa44-08d9-7882-b782-d653915eefd3"},"sequence":4159,"recorded_at":1780531400008313,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa67-d3c3-7381-9173-504f504cd85f"},"task_id":"01a0aa67-d3c3-7381-9173-504f504cd85f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa67-d3c3-7381-9173-504f504cd85f","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-103-1\",\n  \"command\": \"task-board q 'get(TASK-260909-2ez769) { checklist status }' 2>&1 | head -20\",\n  \"description\": \"Read task checklist and status\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\\"checklist\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Preserve and verify all foreign RPC bytes and checkpointed SSH/peer work; isolate only enumerated RPC delta and use managed current-base transition before credentials implementation.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implement exact closed Config4 and Host Trust Store readers; refuse missing, partial, unreadable, ambiguous or downgraded state without implicit legacy fallback.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implement explicit out-of-band enrollment, unique credential-to-host mapping, fresh-key bounded rotation, immediate revocation and current-generation mutation authorization through production APIs.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Provide owner-only credential custody and atomic crash-durable trust writes, with platform custody and crash/recovery evidence and no secret replication.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implement exact-preview confirmed Config4 migration, complete peer enrollment, durable apply and rollback while preserving accepted Config1/2/3 and SSH/peer behavior.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Demonstrate complete pinned v0.6.0 sections 6.6 and 11.10.2/3 acceptance through positive and narrowing-negative production tests; preserve truthful mutation controls and exact-source results; pass required local checks.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"In a managed Story worktree the candidate is left UNCOMMITTED in the worktree for the handoff to snapshot — never commit on the Story branch. A producer commit moves the branch tip off the recorded checkpoint and the handoff refuses with change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint; repair with `git reset --soft \\\\u003ccheckpoint_oid\\\\u003e` before completing again.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lint clean\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implementation matches AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Solution fits project architecture\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Tests green\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gate, refusal, validation, authorization, and attestation behavior attacked, not read — positive-path-only evidence is not accepted\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"If review does not accept the work — verdict evidence added and status routed by the explicit verdict branches\\\",\\\"done\\\":true}],\\\"status\\\":\\\"development\\\"}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3706,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 927,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
