{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e603","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa44-08d9-7882-b782-d653915eefd3"},"sequence":4444,"recorded_at":1780531400008883,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa69-3f08-7932-a0a0-295e1def6f1b"},"task_id":"01a0aa69-3f08-7932-a0a0-295e1def6f1b","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa69-3f08-7932-a0a0-295e1def6f1b","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-112-1\",\n  \"command\": \"head -30 LOGBOOK.md; echo ...; git diff --stat -- LOGBOOK.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Check logbook format\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"# Flight Logbook\\n\\n> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\\n> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\\n\\n## 2026-09-10 (refresh)\\n\\n### TASK-260909-2ez769 refresh — story base moved c1eff01 to a89328c (trunk 8cf4aaa + v0.6.0 adoption)\\n- REFRESH: `task-board worktree refresh-candidate` with exclusive lease (RUN-260910-a4ac2c). Round 1 (43c0e2b peer-identity): 5 file resolutions — LOGBOOK merged newest-first, README trunk + peer tail, 3 traceability files trunk-wins (v0.6.0 registry pin authoritative; v0.5.0 digest superseded). Round 2 (c1eff01 SSH): 4 resolutions reusing round-1 bytes + README with SSH `## SSH stdio transport` section appended and peer-section wording. Packet schema learned from tool errors: entries {checkpoint_oid, path, sha256, content-base64}. Both replayed commits signed oparin@me.com (41106b6, a89328c, verify-commit Good).\\n- COMBINE: worktree restored to candidate snapshot by tool; 30 enumerated incoming paths restored from HEAD (8 adoption files incl. SPEC.v0.6.0.md, v0.6.0.lock.json, ownership.v0.6.0.json, task-board.config.json v0.6.0 cataloggen command); 6 tracked candidate files untouched by adoption kept; LOGBOOK re-merged (HEAD + 2 prior credential entries). Candidate bytes verified 40/40 match pre-refresh fingerprint.\\n- INTEGRATION (real semantic conflicts, resolved preserving both intents): adoption tests pinned \\\"v4 reader unimplemented\\\" — now stale. `compatibility_regression_test.go` const Version4 removed (production wins, same value); v4 lanes now positive per-lane loads (windows/ax.conpty, wsl2/ax.tmux, native plugdirs); conpty-on-v4 now closed-shape refusal (ErrConfigDecode, never version refusal). `schema_test.go` v4 branch now bare-doc required-member refusal + complete-doc positive (SourceVersion 4.0.0, ssh_tls13, host_channel); \\\"unsupported major\\\" renamed. `migration_test.go` assessor now 6 read-only / 10 compatible / 0 refused (was 6/6/4). `migration_refusal_test.go` v4 row now wants ErrMigrationV4Explicit (explicit-preview gate pinned through adoption test).\\n- VALIDATION (head a89328c): gofmt clean; go vet ./... clean; GOOS=windows build hosttrust+config ok; go build ./... ok; go test ./... -count=1 26/26 ok; -cover config 93.2 hosttrust 77.0 peeridentity 97.5 secprim 94.4; tracecheck ok (63/36/101/32, clauses 17/463); catalog v0.6.0 -check ok (former gate-21 input present). Mutation batteries rerun on new base: hosttrust 15 narrowing killed + neutral passed; config 4 narrowing killed + neutral passed; manifests bound to a89328c in mutations-hosttrust-refresh/ and mutations-config-refresh/.\\n- PRESERVATION: RPC backup 15/15 manifest match; parked 11/11 match; tracked RPC paths clean; no rpcwire/UNRESOLVED remnants; RPC delta absent from candidate. Worktree left UNCOMMITTED for snapshot; no main push/integration (orchestrator step).\\n\\n## 2026-09-10 (later)\\n\\n### TASK-260909-2ez769 retry — closed-reader hardening + mutation refresh\\n- SCOPE: same candidate; new gates only in `internal/hosttrust` + 1 census row. No config-package behavior change.\\n- FINDING: `DecodeTrust` never bound identifiers to bytes (crafted/corrupt store with swapped digests decoded) and never checked cross-entry leaf/key/root uniqueness at read time; fixed in `trust_decode.go`/`trust.go` with 5 new refusal rows.\\n- FINDING: `MarkRetiring` (peer catch-up path) missed the no-later-than-old-leaf-expiry cap that `Rotate` enforces; added with `TestMarkRetiringCapsAtLeafExpiry`.\\n- FINDING: `ValidateCustody` never bound the contained leaf to the credential directory name (valid credential filed under another name passed); added digest-vs-dir check with `TestValidateCustodyBindsDirectory`.\\n- FINDING: old `unsorted entries` refusal fixture was malformed JSON (refused on shape, never reached the ordering check); replaced with a genuinely descending valid pair. The `>=`-to-`>` sort mutant stopped killing once the mapping gate subsumed identical entries; re-aimed to `==` (admits unsorted-but-distinct) killing via the genuine fixture.\\n- FINDING: `AuthorizeDispatch` doc overclaimed same-lock check+dispatch; corrected to the actual guarantee (coherent check under shared lock; caller binds generation + watchdog; mutations use exclusive `WithMutationAuthorization`). Stale `transact` missing-store comment and `TOML/JSON` error comment fixed.\\n- VALIDATION (this run): `go build ./...` 0; `go vet` touched pkgs 0; `gofmt` clean; `go test ./... -count=1` all ok; `go test ./... -cover` all ok (hosttrust 77.0%, config 93.2%, peeridentity 97.5%, secprim 94.4%); hosttrust harness 15 narrowing killed + neutral passed; config harness 4 killed + neutral passed; census + refusal-inventory green.\\n- BLOCKER (unchanged, external): CR validation command 21/26 needs adoption files absent on story base c1eff01; `refresh-candidate` still refuses (\\\"requires the final unresolved leaf\\\"). No vendoring, no manual rebase. Candidate left UNCOMMITTED for snapshot.\\n\\n## 2026-09-10\\n\\n### TASK-260909-2ez769 — Host Trust Store 1.0.0 + Config 4.0.0 migration implemented\\n- SCOPE: new `internal/hosttrust` (trust reader/writer, Profile-1 issuance/verify, custody, enroll/rotate/MarkRetiring/revoke, generation authz, export/exclusion); Config 4.0.0 reader/validator/encoder + Preview/Apply/Rollback in `internal/config`; v4 peeridentity interop test; secprim census extended to hosttrust.\\n...\\n LOGBOOK.md | 45 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n 1 file changed, 45 insertions(+)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5459,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1365,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
