{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e62f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa44-08d9-7882-b782-d653915eefd3"},"sequence":4466,"recorded_at":1780531400008927,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"bc8ec94b-72dd-41ff-812d-ceee7d051537"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa69-5f5d-7171-bb97-568d4f1ebadc"},"task_id":"01a0aa69-5f5d-7171-bb97-568d4f1ebadc","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa69-5f5d-7171-bb97-568d4f1ebadc","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 1-6\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-# Flight Logbook\n-\n-> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n-> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n-\n-## 2026-09-10 (refresh)\n+# Flight Logbook\n+\n+> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n+> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n+\n+## 2026-09-16\n+\n+### TASK-260909-2ez769 rework rev5 — CR4 surviving-reader + lock-init findings repaired\n+- F1: pending joint-commit marker is now a general admission barrier (`convergeLocked` + shared-to-exclusive dance `lockForConvergedRead`): every read/admission/transaction entry point converges or refuses before exposing a snapshot. Surviving stores converge exactly like reopened ones; stale bindings compare against the recovered generation (never refreshed). Real child-process crash tests (exit 77) cover surviving + reopened × apply + rollback, marker cleanup, and intervened refusal with marker kept.\n+- F2: lock init is atomic non-replacing (O_CREAT|O_EXCL / CREATE_NEW via `FileSystem.CreateExclusive`); losers open the existing inode. Existing-file verify retries 500ms for the create-to-secure window; non-regular refuses immediately. Deterministic cross-process first-open test pins returnedWhileHeld=false + sameInode=true; the replacing-rename mutant restores the exact reviewer failure shape.\n+- F3: native Windows custody tests written (7, build-tagged; vet + test-compile pass, runtime unverified); config backups classified (byte-exact config copies, 0600, excluded names; Windows backup DACLs a stated bound); row-21 handoff persisted with per-surface API/test obligations + notes on all 7 owned tasks, diagnostics explicitly unowned.\n+- MUTANT LESSON: a JointCommit converge-ignore mutant survives because the staged-marker refusal backstops it — error-ignoring mutants are unobservable where a file-level backstop stands. Paired instead: joint-converge-skip (call-site, killed) + recover-forward-no-bump (narrowing, kills 8 named convergence tests).\n+- EVIDENCE: hosttrust battery 25 narrowing + 1 call-site killed + neutral passed; config 4 semantic + 1 label + neutral passed; full local CI replicated green (test/race/cover/tracecheck/catalog/cigate/fuzz-13/fixtures/claims/windows-compile). 19 of 21 AC rows driven; rows 15 (Windows runtime) and 21 (consumers) bounded, not passed.\n+\n+## 2026-09-10 (refresh)\n","final_result":true}}}
